@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Customer" as Actor
participant "AvailabilityAssistantPage" as UI
participant "AvailabilityAssistantController" as Controller
participant "AvailabilityAssistantService" as Assistant
participant "Gemini API" as Gemini
participant "FieldOperationService" as Fields
database "Database" as DB

== Ask natural-language availability question ==

Actor -> UI : 1. Enter a field request
activate Actor
activate UI
UI -> Controller : 2. POST /api/assistant/availability\n{question}
activate Controller
Controller -> Assistant : 3. answerAvailabilityQuestion(request)
activate Assistant
Assistant -> Assistant : 4. Require authenticated Customer\nand configured API key
activate Assistant
deactivate Assistant

alt Request and configuration are valid
  Assistant -> Fields : 5. fieldTypes()
  activate Fields
  Fields -> DB : 6. Load active field types
  activate DB
  DB --> Fields : 7. Field type summaries
  deactivate DB
  Fields --> Assistant : 8. Field types
  deactivate Fields

  Assistant -> Gemini : 9. Extract date/time/type/budget\nas constrained JSON
  activate Gemini
  Gemini --> Assistant : 10. Search criteria JSON
  deactivate Gemini

  Assistant -> Fields : 11. suggestSlots(verified criteria)
  activate Fields
  Fields -> DB : 12. Load live slots, prices,\nbookings and promotions
  activate DB
  DB --> Fields : 13. Current candidate data
  deactivate DB
  Fields --> Assistant : 14. Ranked verified suggestions
  deactivate Fields

  Assistant -> Gemini : 15. Phrase answer from verified data only
  activate Gemini
  Gemini --> Assistant : 16. Grounded short answer
  deactivate Gemini
  Assistant --> Controller : 17. Answer, criteria and suggestions
else Missing key, invalid request or provider failure
  Assistant --> Controller : 17. ApiException
end
deactivate Assistant
Controller --> UI : 18. HTTP response
deactivate Controller
UI --> Actor : 19. Show answer/suggestions or corrective message
deactivate UI
deactivate Actor

@enduml
